                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "AudioSurf gives you a fun twist on listening to your music saved on your computer, this game allows you to play your legally acquired music files as you \"ride your music\" while trying to dodge obstacles on the track, trying your best to score as high as possible on your selected song. With multiple ways to play along with multiple difficulty levels AudioSurf gives you many options to how you would like to play as well as customization options for how you want the environment to look. This game also just is pretty to look at especially during a song. If you want a fun way to listen to your music on your computer this is your game!\n\nA little bonus if you don't have any music to use yet is the Orange Box soundtrack is included with the game.",
